flowchart LR
  P[Generated / Authored UAT Plan] --> V[Schema + Risk Validation]
  V --> D[Designer Mode]
  D --> R[Runner Wizard]
  R --> C{Checks}
  C -->|Pass| E[Evidence Capture]
  C -->|Fail/Blocked| X[Checkpoint + Diagnostic]
  X --> R
  E --> RV[Reviewer Mode]
  RV --> S[Immutable Sign-off]
  S --> RG[Release Gate]
  CH[Implementation Change] --> ST[Staleness Detector]
  ST -->|possibly stale| RV
